the relative &lt;a href="https://massimo-nocentini.github.io/igraph-rs/igraph/"&gt;documentation&lt;/a&gt;, that
supply bindings over the C library &lt;a href="https://github.com/igraph/igraph"&gt;igraph&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As companion artifact, we provide the corresponding &lt;a href="https://github.com/massimo-nocentini/igraph-rs/pkgs/container/igraph-rs/619892997?tag=master"&gt;Docker container&lt;/a&gt;, that can be pulled with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;docker pull ghcr.io/massimo-nocentini/igraph-rs:master
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>